<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Podcatcher: Hannes Nagel</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Podcatcher is a podcast app for iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch with iCloud sync, up to 5x speed, transcripts, automatic chapters, and chapter skip rules. Currently in development.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/neon.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero pod-hero">
            <span class="status-pill pod"><span class="dot"></span>In development, coming to the App Store</span>
            <h1>Podcasts, the way <em>you</em> listen.</h1>
            <p class="lead">The Podcatcher is the podcast app I am building right now for iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch. Fast playback, transcripts, smart chapters, and rules that skip the parts you never listen to anyway.</p>

            <div class="player" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="player-top">
                    <span class="player-title">Now playing<small>Your favorite show, just faster</small></span>
                    <div class="speed-row">
                        <span class="hint">Playback speed</span>
                        <button class="speed-btn" data-rate="1" type="button">1×</button>
                        <button class="speed-btn on" data-rate="2" type="button">2×</button>
                        <button class="speed-btn" data-rate="3" type="button">3×</button>
                        <button class="speed-btn" data-rate="5" type="button">5×</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="eq" id="eq"></div>
                <div class="chapters">
                    <div class="chapter-bar">
                        <span class="skip" style="flex: 1.2"></span>
                        <span style="flex: 5"></span>
                        <span class="skip" style="flex: 1.6"></span>
                        <span style="flex: 4"></span>
                        <span style="flex: 1.4"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chapter-legend">
                        <span class="skipped">Intro</span>
                        <span><b>Interview</b></span>
                        <span class="skipped">Sponsor read</span>
                        <span>Deep dive</span>
                        <span>Outro</span>
                        <span style="margin-left:auto" class="pod-accent">↑ skipped by your rules</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work pod-cards">
            <div class="section-head">
                <p class="sub-header" style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">What it does</p>
                <h2>For people who <em>listen a lot</em>.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="cards">
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 5 13.5h6L10 22l9-11.5h-6L13 2z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Up to 5× speed</h3>
                        <p>Smooth playback from 1× all the way to 5×, for when you want the information, not the pauses.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="3.5" width="14" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 12.5h6M9 16h3.5"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Transcripts</h3>
                        <p>Read along, search what was said, and jump straight to the moment a sentence was spoken.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.5 13.8 9 19.5 11 13.8 13 12 18.5 10.2 13 4.5 11 10.2 9 12 3.5z"/><path d="M18.5 16.5l.7 1.8 1.8.7-1.8.7-.7 1.8-.7-1.8-1.8-.7 1.8-.7.7-1.8z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Automatic chapters</h3>
                        <p>Episodes without chapters get them generated automatically, so long shows become navigable.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 5.5l7 6.5-7 6.5v-13z"/><path d="M13 5.5l7 6.5-7 6.5v-13z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Chapter skip rules</h3>
                        <p>Tell it once that you never want intros or sponsor reads, and it skips them on every episode.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 18.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-.6-8.96A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 17.1 8.7 4.3 4.3 0 0 1 16.8 18.5H7z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>iCloud sync</h3>
                        <p>Subscriptions, queue, and playback positions stay in sync across all your devices.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2.5" y="5" width="13.5" height="9.5" rx="2"/><path d="M7 18.5h4.5"/><path d="M9.25 14.5v4"/><rect x="17.5" y="9" width="4" height="9.5" rx="1.4"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>iPhone, iPad, Mac &amp; Watch</h3>
                        <p>One app everywhere, with the Mac version built using Catalyst and an Apple Watch app with standalone playback.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <div class="doc-content">
                <p class="sub-header" style="color: var(--neon-cyan);">Transcripts, for example</p>
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">Find the sentence, not the timestamp.</h2>
                <p style="max-width: 62ch;">Every episode can have a transcript you can read and search. Tap a line and playback jumps right there.</p>
                <div class="transcript" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div><span class="ts">12:04</span>…and that is the thing nobody tells you about shipping apps:</div>
                    <div><span class="ts">12:09</span>the first version is <span class="hl">always embarrassing</span>, and that is fine.</div>
                    <div><span class="ts">12:14</span>You improve it step by step, every single week.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="footer-cta">
            <p class="sub-header">Honest status</p>
            <h2>It is not out yet, I am building it <em>right now</em>.</h2>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.6rem;">No release date promises. If you want to hear when it ships, or want to try early builds, just write me.</p>
            <div class="links">
                <a href="/contact">Contact me</a>
                <a href="/apps">All apps</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
    <script>
        (function () {
            var eq = document.getElementById('eq');
            if (!eq) { return; }
            var bars = Math.min(48, Math.max(24, Math.floor(window.innerWidth / 24)));
            for (var i = 0; i < bars; i++) {
                var bar = document.createElement('i');
                bar.style.setProperty('--h', (22 + Math.random() * 78) + '%');
                bar.style.setProperty('--d', (380 + Math.random() * 520) + 'ms');
                bar.style.setProperty('--dl', (-Math.random() * 800) + 'ms');
                eq.appendChild(bar);
            }
            eq.style.setProperty('--rate', 2);

            var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.speed-btn');
            btns.forEach(function (b) {
                b.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
                    btns.forEach(function (o) { o.classList.remove('on'); });
                    b.classList.add('on');
                    eq.style.setProperty('--rate', b.getAttribute('data-rate'));
                    if (b.getAttribute('data-rate') === '5' && window.hnConfetti) {
                        window.hnConfetti(e.clientX, e.clientY, 40);
                    }
                });
            });
        })();
    </script>
</body>

</html>
